    {
      "id": "s02",
      "text": {
        "en": "It began five years ago. One evening, a thick green fog suddenly swallowed the whole town. No one understood what was going on. Then the ground in the middle of the square split open! A giant creature burst out and swallowed three people.",
        "uz": "Bu besh yil oldin boshlangan. Bir kuni kechqurun shaharni to'satdan yashil tuman qopladi. Hech kim nima bo'layotganini tushunmadi. Shunda maydonning o'rtasida yer yorildi! Ulkan maxluq chiqib, uch kishini yutib yubordi."
      },
