    {
      "id": "s03",
      "text": {
        "en": "Ever since, the fog comes back almost every day. And anyone caught on the ground just vanishes.",
        "uz": "O'sha kundan beri tuman deyarli har kuni tushadi. Kim yerda qolsa, g'oyib bo'ladi."
      },
