    {
      "id": "s04",
      "text": {
        "en": "Last year, a girl was riding her bike when the sirens went off. She pedaled toward her house as fast as she could, but she was too slow. The creature shot up from under the road. All that was left was her bike.",
        "uz": "O'tgan yili bir qiz velosipedda ketayotganda sirena chalindi. U uyiga qarab shoshildi, lekin ulgurmadi. Yer ostidan maxluq otilib chiqdi. Uning velosipedi yo'lda yolg'iz qoldi."
      },
