    {
      "id": "s05",
      "text": {
        "en": "Only one man ever made it out alive. He was driving home when the fog came down. Out of nowhere, the road cracked open and the creature lunged at his car! He leaped out and scrambled onto a bus stop roof. The creature dragged his car underground. Since then, everyone knows the rule: you have ten seconds to get off the ground.",
        "uz": "Lekin bir kishi tirik qoldi. U mashinada ketayotganida tuman tushdi. To'satdan yo'l yorilib, maxluq mashinaga tashlandi! U sakrab chiqib, bekat tomiga chiqib oldi. Mashinasini esa maxluq yer ostiga sudrab ketdi. Shuning uchun hammada tomga chiqish uchun atigi o'n soniya bor."
      },
