    {
      "id": "s06",
      "text": {
        "en": "Usually, the fog lifts in thirty seconds. But yesterday was different. My little brother and I were walking home from school, when suddenly... the sirens! We climbed onto a shop roof. Thirty seconds went by, then five minutes, and the fog still didn't lift!",
        "uz": "Odatda tuman o'ttiz soniyada tarqaydi. Lekin kecha hammasi boshqacha bo'ldi. Ukam bilan maktabdan qaytayotgan edik, to'satdan... sirena! Biz do'konning tomiga chiqib oldik. O'ttiz soniya o'tdi, keyin besh daqiqa, lekin tuman tarqamadi!"
      },
