    {
      "id": "s07",
      "text": {
        "en": "Down on the street, a car blasted its horn, and the creature dove right back underground. So it's afraid of loud noise! That's when I remembered the old clock tower. Dad always said its bell could be heard across the entire town!",
        "uz": "Pastda bir mashina qattiq signal chalganda, maxluq yerga sho'ng'ib qochib ketdi. Demak, u baland ovozdan qo'rqadi! Shunda eski soat minorasini esladim. Dadam aytgan edi, uning qo'ng'irog'i butun shaharga eshitiladi!"
      },
