    {
      "id": "s08",
      "text": {
        "en": "We jumped from roof to roof until we reached the tower. But the bell mechanism was broken! While I was fixing it, the ground started shaking beneath us. My brother grabbed a metal bucket and started banging on it.",
        "uz": "Biz tomlardan sakrab, minoraga yetib keldik. Lekin qo'ng'iroq mexanizmi buzuq edi! Uni tuzatayotganimda, oyog'imiz ostida yer titray boshladi. Ukam temir chelakni olib, taqillatdi."
      },
